==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|eo|en|have|notext=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈhavi/|lang=eo}}
* {{hyphenation|ha|vi|lang=eo}}

===Verb===
{{eo-head}}

# {{lb|eo|transitive}} to [[have]]
#: {{ux|eo|Mi '''havas''' elektran torĉon, sed mi ne '''havas''' bateriojn.|I '''have''' a flashlight, but I don't '''have''' batteries.}}

====Usage notes====
'''-hava''' is sometimes used like a suffix meaning "-having". For example, while {{m|eo|barba}} means related to beards in a general way, {{m|eo|barbhava}} specifically means "having a beard".

